                <button class="drive-control-setting" data-debug-command="toggle-snow-v4" data-debug-state="snow-presentation"><span><strong>SNOW DETAIL QUALITY</strong><small>LOW · MEDIUM · HIGH · ULTRA</small></span><b>MEDIUM</b></button>
